WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to the Digital Government Exchange 2026 multimedia experience.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
DGX brings together speakers, government representatives and technology professionals.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Delegates exchange ideas, build professional connections and explore digital-government opportunities.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The programme also includes shared experiences such as the Sarawak River Cruise.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
DGX 2026 connects people, ideas and digital government in Kuching, Sarawak.
